   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Edit an image (Qwen)\n\n1. **Pick your image** in the green *Load Image* box: click \"choose file to upload\".\n2. **Write what should change** in the green *Your edit* box, like \"make the jacket red\".\n3. Click the blue **Run** button at the top of the screen.\n4. Your result shows in *Result* and is saved to `ComfyUI/output`.\n\n**Speed:** about 8 minutes on this Mac at the default settings (20 steps, 0.5 megapixels).\n\n**Faster test:** set steps to 8. **Better quality:** set steps to 30-40, or Size (megapixels) to 1.0. Both take longer.\n\n**NSFW LoRA:** on by default. Change its strength from 0.0 to 1.0. To switch it off, right-click the node and choose Bypass.\n"
   ]
  },
